From 97dfcb6e759391e2b264ee65f3fd9049d4403aed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:19:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Board: move onto the page structure (BoardPage +
 BoardPageContext)

KanbanBoard becomes BoardPage, the page's container: it takes over BoardScreen's two-layer layout and renders BoardHeader and ProgressDashboard itself, so BoardScreen is gone and /kanban renders <BoardPage {...board} />. The new BoardPageContext carries pullToTodo; MobileBacklogCard reads it instead of taking an onPull prop. toBoardCards and the column and backlog frames are unchanged.

Design Console: the two board tabs render BoardPage; the inline mobile backlog sheet and the MobileBacklogCard specimen render inside inertBoardPageContext().

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KCt6pLaQcffbbgWyRsYruK
